letics Department - Business Affairs | Requisition Number: 74646 | Boulder,                             Colorado | Temporary Staff | Full-Time | Posting End Date: 09-Sep-2026 | Date Posted: 02-Sep-2026 CU Boulder Athletics encourages applications for a temporary grounds crew member! This position will assist with all grounds related work for CU Athletics. The successful candidate will have good communication skills, the ability to take direction, and a background in ground maintenance. Duties... Learn More Share Facebook X Email Alumni C Club Intern: Membership and Data Athletics Department - Business Affairs | Requisition Number: 74629 | Boulder,                             Colorado | Temporary Staff | Full-Time | Posting End Date: 08-Sep-2026 | Date Posted: 02-Sep-2026 CU Boulder encourages applications for a Temporary Alumni C Club Intern! This role supports the programs, events, communications, data management, and relationship-building efforts of the Alumni C Club, Colorado Athletics’ Letterwinners association.The Alumni C Club serves former University of... Learn More Share Facebook X Email Manager of Operations, Campus Business Services Business,  Finance and Infrastructure | Requisition Number: 74627 | Boulder,                             Colorado | University Staff | Full-Time | Posting End Date: 16-Sep-2026 | Date Posted: 02-Sep-2026 The Business, Finance and Infrastructure division at CU Boulder welcomes applications for the Manager of Operations, Campus Business Services position! Campus Business Services (CBS) is a shared services team within the Business, Finance and Infrastructure unit that provides financial and... Learn More Share Facebook X Email Research Associate Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering | Requisition Number: 74623 | Boulder,                             Colorado | Research Faculty | Full-Time | Posting End Date: 04-Sep-2026 | Date Posted: 02-Sep-2026 The Department of Electrical, Computer and Energy Engineering (ECEE) at CU Boulder is seeking a Research Associate. Learn More Share Facebook X Email Senior Advancement Assistant, Donor Relations Office of Advancement | Requisition Number: 74621 | Boulder,                             Colorado | University Staff | Full-Time | Posting End Date: 15-Sep-2026 | Date Posted: 02-Sep-2026 The Office of Advancement encourages applications for a Senior Advancement Assistant! This role operates as a key support member of the central Donor Relations team and uses autonomy, independence and subject matter expertise to provide administrative support for a high-performing and... Learn More Share Facebook X Email Temporary Field Technician Institute for Arctic and Alpine Research (INSTAAR) | Requisition Number: 74612 | Boulder,                             Colorado | Research Faculty | Part-Time | Posting End Date: 04-Sep-2026 | Date Posted: 02-Sep-2026 INSTARR welcomes applications for a Temporary Field Technician! Learn More Share Facebook X Email Senior Scientist Molecular, Cellular, and Developmental Biology Department | Requisition Number: 74599 | Boulder,                             Colorado | Research Faculty | Part-Time | Posting End Date: 07-Sep-2026 | Date Posted: 02-Sep-2026 The Brumbaugh lab is seeking enthusiastic and talented applicants for an open Research Associate position. This position would include both research and administrative opportunities. The ideal candidate would be highly organized and possess strong interpersonal skills. Lab experience,... Learn More Share Facebook X Email Senior Guidance, Navigation, & Control Engineer Laboratory for Atmospheric and Space Physics (LASP) | Requisition Number: 74595 | Boulder,                             Colorado | Research Faculty | Full-Time | Posting End Date: 04-Sep-2026 | Date Posted: 02-Sep-2026 LASP is seeking a full-time Guidance, Navigation & Controls (GNC) system engineer for an asteroid exploration mission. Learn More Share Facebook X Email Senior QA Engineer Laboratory for Atmosp