l Specialist A&S HR | Requisition Number: 74607 | Boulder,                             Colorado | University Staff | Part-Time | Posting End Date: 13-Sep-2026 | Date Posted: 01-Sep-2026 The College of Arts and Sciences (A&S) at CU Boulder invites applications for The A&S Rotational Specialist position! This role is part of the A&S Job Rotation Program and is designed to provide generalist support to academic departments and the Office of the Dean within the College... Learn More Share Facebook X Email Information Technology (IT) Support Specialist Office of Contracts and Grants (OCG) | Requisition Number: 74606 | Boulder,                             Colorado | University Staff | Full-Time | Posting End Date: 08-Sep-2026 | Date Posted: 01-Sep-2026 The Office of Contracts and Grants (OCG) within the Research & Innovation Office (RIO) seeks an Information Technology (IT) Specialist to support OCG through the effective use of automation and technology solutions. This position serves as the bridge between OCG staff and technology... Learn More Share Facebook X Email Assistant Teaching Professor A&S Residential Acadademic Programs | Requisition Number: 74312 | Boulder,                             Colorado | Faculty | Full-Time | Posting End Date: 15-Oct-2026 | Date Posted: 01-Sep-2026 The Program for Writing and Rhetoric (PWR) and the College of Arts & Sciences Residential Academic Program (A&S RAP) at the University of Colorado Boulder invite applications for a joint Assistant Teaching Professor position. The successful candidate will teach lower and upper-division... Learn More Share Facebook X Email Program Coordinator, Native and Indigenous Students Center for Cultural Connections & Community | Requisition Number: 74575 | Boulder,                             Colorado | University Staff | Full-Time | Posting End Date: 21-Sep-2026 | Date Posted: 31-Aug-2026 The Center for Cultural Connections and Community welcomes applications for the Program Coordinator for Native and