    "https://colorado.avature.net/jobs": {
      "title": "JobsUNIVERSITY OF COLORADOBOULDER",
      "description": "Find Jobs - CU Boulder Jobs Jobs UNIVERSITY OF COLORADO BOULDER Jobs UNIVERSITY OF COLORADO BOULDER Reasonable Accommodations for Applicants with Disabilities CU Boulder is committed to making information and resources that are available via the web accessible for all users. The CU Boulder careers site used to apply for staff positions is currently not fully accessible for individuals who are using screen readers and other assistive technologies, however, we are working with the supplier to make this accessible to all. If you use assistive technology and need to access the CU Boulder staff careers site please contact the ADA coordinator by email at adacoordinator@colorado.edu or call 303-492-9725 for assistance. Skip to content Search jobs Living Here Benefits Perks Jobs Join the CU Boulder Talent Community Create Job Alert FAQ Login Join the CU Boulder Talent Community Create Job Alert FAQ Login Home Search Jobs Search Jobs Search for open positions Area of Interest Academic Advising Administrative Support Admissions Art/Design Athletics Business/Management Communications/Media/PR/Marketing Contracts and Grants Custodial Customer Service/Retail Driving/Transportation Engineering Environmental Services Event Planning Executive Management/Senior Admin Faculty/Instruction Finance and Accounting Food Service Fundraising/Alumni Relations General Labor Healthcare Human Resources IT - Data and Cloud Management IT - Desktop Support IT - Dev, Architecture, Enterprise CRM IT - Network or System Administration IT - Other IT - Project Management IT - Security Legal Libraries Museum Performing Arts Support Planning, Design, Construction Project Management Public Safety Research Residence Life Skilled Trades Student Services Functional Area Select an option Academic Affairs Athletics Business and Finance Chancellor's Office College of Arts & Sciences College of Communication, Media, Design, and Information (CMDI) College of Engineering & Applied Science Col